{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_07_beg","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_07","title":"光與影","storyCode":"GA-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"bcc095aea6579cde69680f487074f71febe5e83554b76387e1604c2fce3499a1","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"幻想也好，理想也罷，如果不是追尋曾經相信的東西，我們怎麼走到今天？也許我們都曾天真。但人不必為天真後悔。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g9_laterano_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喜悅的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺城裡好熱鬧啊，是因為會議要開幕了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是吧，好多地方都在爆炸，看來大家都很興奮嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喜悅的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......一個執行者，一個萬國信使？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喜悅的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是在幹啥，跑酷比賽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼熱鬧？你玩不玩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喜悅的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走唄！看看追不追得上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到這裡應該......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是難纏啊，費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"你也很難纏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我調查過，你現在應該沒有任務在身......你根本就休假了啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真是搞不懂了，你咬著我不放做什麼？我什麼時候得罪你了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我的上一項任務，是前往敘拉古將一位當地薩科塔的遺物送回拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"他的遺物中有一本筆記，記載了他曾經目睹一名女性薩科塔與薩卡茲接觸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，那你要查也正常。但是關我什麼事？我是男的哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我追溯各種線索，最終找到這名女性的住址是拉特蘭城司提望區瑟法斯街7-265號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到達那裡時，發現她已經去世了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你只好繼續調查她的行蹤記錄，然後發現她有一些可疑的出行，而每一次這種可疑的出行之前，她都和我這個萬國信使有過聯絡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈！有意思，太有意思了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還想是我在維多利亞露了馬腳？或者哪一次和安多恩聯絡留了痕跡？沒想到竟然是因為好心幫費莉亞的這一點小忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也可謂是命運的一種了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"感慨完了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，費德里科，如果我沒猜錯，你現在應該無法感知我的情緒吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"不能，我也不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"緝捕對象的情緒與我無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你緝捕對象的人，他們的情緒你就在乎嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和我一樣，我們都多少拒絕了共感......依我看，我們大可以交個朋友啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我覺得，拉特蘭是應該多一點你這樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要那麼同情心氾濫，單純以法規為準則行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我不反對這個觀點。或許等你的審判結束後，我可以到監獄裡和你交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，這就是你的理由，奧倫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......最麻煩的傢伙出現了。我這樣日行一善的人為什麼會倒楣成這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"樞機薇爾麗芙，你好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，執行者費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叛徒奧倫的處置接下來移交第七廳，公證所方面可以轉項結案了，你關於此事的報告麻煩抄送第七廳、第一廳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的認證碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"確認完畢，程序合規。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，你想繼續休假還是臨時參與迷途者緝捕行動？隨你高興。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇爾，你說，有人聽過費德里科說再見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別套近乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是來幫我的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想把我繩之以法，只要等費德里科幹完他的活兒就行了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，也有可能費德里科確實敵不過我......但你也沒必要把他打發走，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是發現你比我以為的有用一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科上報之後，我本以為你只是安多恩的幫手......但現在看來，你還不算太廢物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倍感榮幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞的存在對拉特蘭是天然的威脅，你不希望這個威脅被抹去......不是因為你想實踐這個威脅，而是你想用這個威脅做交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天上掉下來的一筆錢，大家都不想用，讓我很痛心哪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我對拉特蘭是第一等的忠心，薇爾麗芙你是知道我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是最支持教宗閣下理想的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不認同閣下的方式，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就比如這場會議，你從心底裡覺得它不會有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你覺得會有用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇爾麗芙，你對維多利亞的現狀瞭解多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會不明白，我們距離一場戰爭有多麼的近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下在這個時期，動用佈局數十年的力量，即使撬動了大部分國家，但來的人還是......分量太輕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在更平和的年代，或許我們確實可以以此為基礎，慢慢佈局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但情況並非如此。如果要實現閣下的理想，沒有那麼多時間讓我們溫吞吞地做事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在維多利亞親眼見證了無數更骯髒的手段，我不會說那是正確的，但如果正確不能達成目的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，薇爾麗芙，你寧願成為一個高尚的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧倫，在這種時候，你的話通常沒有這麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在等什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實剛才我改變了主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在外走動這麼多年，我越來越不相信薩科塔有多麼獨特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是能夠互相分享情感，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就在剛才，即便是我，也不得不承認......我感受到了某種古老的、悠久的東西，它真正來自我的內心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並且，我們獲得了一張牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各國使者聚首拉特蘭之日，拉特蘭降下神跡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這意味著什麼，這能夠意味著什麼，我們有很多事可以做，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一點，你可能想錯了。你覺得萬國峰會不該誕生在多事之秋......我建議你，不如反過來考慮一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過呢，你也有想得不錯的地方。教宗閣下也許有不方便做的事。但於我而言，做兩手準備沒有壞處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇爾麗芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_361_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很好運，奧倫，因為我確實用得著你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出來吧，帕蒂亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算你們還有點理智，沒有讓你們的薩卡茲同伴們參與到城內的騷亂活動中......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果使節們真的在拉特蘭城裡親眼目睹了“前來破壞萬國峰會的薩卡茲”......這件事情可就沒那麼好收場了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想說什麼，菲亞梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩已經在去往大教堂的路上了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道了什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要和你彙報，帕蒂亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在去找他算帳之前，我得讓你先停下來，別再繼續這些愚蠢又煩人的小動作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你們可能是還有那麼一絲理智，並不真的要對萬國峰會動手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我勸你們不要冒險，事情未必總如我們所願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......？現在輪到你來“說服”我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是給你一個小小的忠告，如果你不高興聽，我當然不介意......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亞梅塔，告訴我你是怎麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼怎麼想的？我做我的工作......了結我要清算的帳，有什麼複雜的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......八年前，你為什麼離開戍衛隊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......戍衛隊不能外派，要掛靠到公證所才行。這有什麼好問的？你關心這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕蒂亞，我不明白你在耿耿於懷些什麼。也許你在我身上寄託了些什麼，我不知道，關於你那些黎博利就應當如何如何的大道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一點都不在乎，帕蒂亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信任的隊友背叛了同伴，我的朋友因此受傷、因此被流放，甚至可能從此被叛徒盯上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經錯失了一次......我不能讓這件事再度發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要保護她們，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這不符合你的什麼幻想，我也不會說抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......別得意，莫斯提馬。換了你，難道你不會這麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說得對，是我的幻想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻想又怎樣？幻想也好，理想也罷，如果不是追尋曾經相信的東西，我又怎麼走到今天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許把理想寄託在別人身上是我的天真，但我不後悔，菲亞梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不懂你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以現在，我也不會後退。就算我做的這些......在你看來只是“愚蠢又煩人”的把戲。這是我的任務，我就會完成到底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我停下，就來打倒我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣很好，帕蒂亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_279_excu","aliases":["費德里科"]}]}
